 //------------------------------------------------------------------------------
+//AI(W906-SAFEPLC) 20261006: EastSun 1006「都幫我補上」(the safety-PLC mode, SafePlcIO). Port-only.
+//  Golden's TClientSocket is a real ctNonBlocking VCL socket whose OnConnect / OnRead / OnDisconnect / OnError arrive through
+//  the main thread's message loop. vclcompat's TClientSocket defaults to SIM (no OS socket); POLLED-Real (H-008, the same
+//  switch DTME08 / TesterTCP / HANA RMS use) gives the golden shape: Active=true starts a non-blocking connect and Poll()
+//  fires the four events on the thread that calls it. Called by MyPLC/SafePlcClock_St02.cpp only when SafePlcIO=1.
+//  SetSimMode(false) takes effect at the next Active=true, so a socket opened earlier in SIM is re-opened by the caller.
+void ModbusTCPClient::W906_UsePolledRealSocket()
+{
+    pClinetSocket->SetPolled(true);
+    pClinetSocket->SetSimMode(false);
+}
+int ModbusTCPClient::W906_Poll()
+{
+    return pClinetSocket->Poll();
+}
+//------------------------------------------------------------------------------
